      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Skeletal hands burst from up to four 10-ft squares within 120 ft (placed as a 20-ft square; the area is Difficult Terrain for your enemies). Any enemy there when they appear, entering, or ending its turn there makes a STR save (once per turn): on a failure 6d6 Necrotic damage and it subtracts 1d6 from its damage rolls until the end of its next turn. +1d6 per slot level above 5.</p>",
